71b167d41c8e92aac7df1e5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ojagaさん\nこんにちは！\nお願いいたします！！どうかもう一度黒響を描いてください！！！十分にかっこよければそれで結構です！！！\n構図等はお任せでお願い致します。\nお任せの依頼となりますがご検討よろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@jaga_mohu/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/13ee9f6f/uploads/origins/3a1a3e7e-1d64-498a-9b6d-438f040603c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b8d7141b24f3e3216f797d18b4055b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13ee9f6f/uploads/origins/3a1a3e7e-1d64-498a-9b6d-438f040603c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b8d7141b24f3e3216f797d18b4055b5, https://si.imgix.net/13ee9f6f/uploads/origins/3a1a3e7e-1d64-498a-9b6d-438f040603c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54a06248857a1f2e5dcb44275473ac9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13ee9f6f/uploads/origins/3a1a3e7e-1d64-498a-9b6d-438f040603c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=244e31727a46069692d6d9b7087b1a03 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、僕と僕の友達のOC \"Lily \"と \"Otoha \"の写真をリクエストしたいんだけど。\n\nLily \"が \"miku \"の服を着て。\n\n音羽 \"は \"ヒビク \"の服を着ている。\n\n二人で助け合って戦う。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ilf9jqrFrBjxnkkoDdwVohduueIwVvhL?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@jaga_mohu/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4f585d29/uploads/origins/34a2735a-ba4a-432c-be24-7985d0701410?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2170fc292d776c5dece4c540cbe0468f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4f585d29/uploads/origins/34a2735a-ba4a-432c-be24-7985d0701410?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2170fc292d776c5dece4c540